  "policies_note": "Documented relaxations of the literal CONTRACT wording, each one required by a real workorder shape: (a) membrane_anchored may sit in an adjacent cytosolic compartment (RAS-GTP); (b) a binding partner on a membrane band is adjacent to both sides, so ligand-receptor binding across the bilayer is not a E_COMPARTMENT_MISMATCH; (c) a self-edge (from == to, e.g. EGFR autophosphorylation) carries no rank change, so it is exempt from the strict rank increase and from cycle detection; (d) a transcription factor that translocates may start the edge outside the nucleus when the model declares crosses[]; (e) transport without crosses[] is a warning when the endpoint containers already differ, and an error only when no boundary is crossed.",
